## Proto contract

Shared protobuf definitions live in `proto/`. `buf lint` + `buf breaking` guard
backward compatibility (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`).
{%- endif %}

## Update from the template

```bash
msvc-gen update --output .
```

Re-runs `copier update` for each `services/<name>/` and re-renders this root
layer. Never edit `.copier-answers.yml` by hand.

